id: yaki-master
name: Yaki Master
talentCategory: racial
race: yardrat
prerequisites: Yaki Swarm Talent, Battle Yardrat Awakening
description: >
  Your swarm of bonded Yaki fight together as one, anticipating your needs.
text: >
  Yaki Master: Your swarm of bonded Yaki fight together as one, anticipating your needs.
  –Prerequisites: Yaki Swarm Talent, Battle Yardrat Awakening
  (1)-[Passive]: While you are not Bonded, all of your Yaki are considered Bonded for the 3rd effect of Yaki Swarm.
  (2)-[Triggered/Start of Combat Round]: If you are not Bonded, target one of your Yaki Minions. That Yaki gains access to its Act Phase this Combat Round and gains 1 Counter Action.

---

# The Battle Yardrat Awakening it asks for waits on Awakenings.
[passive]
# (1) Not Bonded yourself: every Yaki of yours Bonded for Yaki Swarm (3) (allies.mjs minionGifts).
allow yakiMaster.allBonded;

# (2) On the Round's card: not Bonded, a Yaki asked - its Act Phase and a Counter Action (chat.mjs yakiMaster).
[triggered/start-of-round, effect 2]
yakiMaster();
